<title>USA: U.S. zinc stocks down in December - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. zinc stocks down in December - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total U.S. slab zinc stocks held by smelters fell to 7,239 short tons at the end of December from a total of 8,152 short tons at the end of November, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Zinc production also fell to 19,629 short tons in December from a total of 21,176 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>Shipments from smelters' plants rose to 20,735 short tons in the month from 19,047 short tons in November.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
